# Every key listed here is forwarded into the sandbox; anything absent is not.
# A key with an empty value falls back to the same name in the host environment,
# which is why the blanks below are usable as-is on a machine that already has
# them set.

# The provider the agent talks to. This machine reaches Claude through a gateway,
# so the sandbox needs all three — a model the gateway serves, and the endpoint
# and token to reach it.
ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=
ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=

# Or, to use a Claude subscription or an Anthropic API key instead of a gateway:
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=   # from `claude setup-token` on the host
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
